{"lyrics":"[00:02.96]Uh (my baby you've been, my best, my only friend)\n[00:07.22]I low-key should have wrote this when I first met you\n[00:09.16]But, yeah\n[00:11.28]Hope you like it, listen, here you go\n[00:14.22]Uh, I'm in the studio early with it today man, it's worth it, yeah\n[00:28.98]Uh-uh, uh-uh, uh-uh, turn me up in my headphones\n[00:35.54]Yeah, look, listen, listen\n[00:43.64]I wanna set aside time, but I can't describe the way that I feel\n[00:46.94]This ain't a love song but above all, I just wanna keep this shit real\n[00:50.36]Low-key, these words are so overdue, and you, yeah you, you're so over cute\n[00:54.10]So beautiful, to my cubicle when you around, it's a marvelous view\n[00:57.86]Me and you should just take a drive, uh-huh\n[01:00.54]See the fuck shit in the rear view\n[01:01.96]It appears that it's clear to, just revealed to you how I feel for you\n[01:04.40]Gotta keep it real for you, we just hope that you listening (listen)\n[01:06.68]Can't see much, but like Stevie I'm a wonder with the vision looks like it's an interest (Interest)\n[01:10.34]Take a chance, hell yeah, we can risk it, girl we can risk it\n[01:12.82]Damn, my thoughts are all over the place and I see your blessing all over your face\n[01:17.60]For you outta this world, but I met you in space\n[01:19.52]I'm screaming out \"Wait!\", before I continue, I just really wanna get one thing straight\n[01:23.22]You make the sun look like a freeze pop, somebody pass me the goddamn sunscreen\n[01:26.72]And I was just wondering, maybe, baby can you hang out on a weekend or a weekday like a Monday or a Wednesday\n[01:33.04]Maybe we can T-up on a Tuesday, maybe one day, maybe two days, just a few days, just a few more\n[01:37.44]I don't play games, but with this wordplay, shit, a nigga still got the high score, plus a lot more\n[01:43.52]Yeah-yeah\n[01:44.86]Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, uh\n[01:48.68]Uh-uh-uh-uh, ayy\n[01:48.96]Uh-uh-uh-uh, haha, ayy\n[01:53.64]Ayy, this my favorite part right here, listen\n[01:55.06]Some old school shit, you feel me, haha (I'll make you believe)\n[02:00.34]Away from me, yeah, ayy (Away from me)\n[02:10.32]No need to run, I can't run, there ain't no hiding, I'm done\n[02:13.68]I'm gonna say how I feel, then I may roll me a blunt\n[02:17.62]You tell me quit all this smoking, it's too much weed in my lungs\n[02:21.40]I say I quit, I don't mean it, 'cause there's still weed in my lungs\n[02:24.98]But I could promise you this, you get me higher than that\n[02:28.52]You see that airplane in the sky? Well girl, you flyer than that\n[02:32.20]And when I get this record deal, I may just buy you a jet\n[02:35.60]'Cause I just think you the best person that I've ever met\n[02:39.40]Perfect, but better than that, worth it, I think that's a fact\n[02:43.18]I hope you listen to this, think about it, give it a chance\n[02:46.84]I know I'm feeling you lady, I hope you feeling a kid\n[02:50.38]But I'm not kidding with you, no-no, this is words to a man\n[02:53.70]I'll write this for you again, fuck it, again and again\n[02:57.60]I'll do it over and over and over 'til you give in\n[03:01.28]I hope I've caused a commotion, emotion, you to commend\n[03:05.00]I wanna tell you more about it, but this song finna end\n[03:08.68]Na-na-na-na\n[03:10.54]Ayy, haha\n[03:38.14]Hope you like it\n[03:43.52]Uh-uh, uh-uh, uh-uh","words":[[2.96,3.12,"Uh"],[3.3,3.32,"(my"],[3.36,3.42,"baby"],[3.46,3.56,"you've"],[3.6,3.7,"been,"],[3.74,3.94,"my"],[4.06,5.84,"best,"],[5.88,6.1,"my"],[6.52,6.72,"only"],[7.06,7.18,"friend)"],[7.22,7.22,"I"],[7.26,7.48,"low-key"],[7.56,7.66,"should"],[7.7,7.76,"have"],[7.8,7.94,"wrote"],[7.98,8.12,"this"],[8.18,8.26,"when"],[8.34,8.34,"I"],[8.42,8.64,"first"],[8.72,8.88,"met"],[8.92,8.96,"you"],[9.16,9.24,"But,"],[9.28,9.38,"yeah"],[11.28,11.36,"Hope"],[11.4,11.44,"you"],[11.5,11.78,"like"],[12.3,12.34,"it,"],[12.42,12.62,"listen,"],[13.1,13.16,"here"],[13.24,13.28,"you"],[13.34,13.4,"go"],[14.22,14.28,"Uh,"],[24.0,24.06,"I'm